  "articleBody": "A second-story addition can create substantial living space without expanding the home’s footprint, but it requires careful review of the existing foundation, framing, zoning, plans, permits, and construction access. Before hiring a design-build company, confirm that the proposed layout fits your goals, the structure can support another level, and the quote clearly includes design, approvals, construction, and final inspections.",
